flowchart TD
    A([START]) --> B[/Read farmer ID, litres, fat, SNF, shift/]
    B --> C{Farmer ID and shift valid?}
    C -- No --> X[/Display invalid identity or shift/]
    C -- Yes --> D{Litres finite and greater than 0?}
    D -- No --> Y[/Display invalid quantity/]
    D -- Yes --> E{Fat between 2.0 and 7.0?}
    E -- No --> Z[/Display invalid fat/]
    E -- Yes --> F{SNF finite and non-negative?}
    F -- No --> W[/Display invalid SNF/]
    F -- Yes --> G[Calculate fat and SNF steps]
    G --> H[Calculate rate per litre]
    H --> I[Calculate exact delivery value and add to farmer's total]
    I --> J[Round ten-day farmer total once to paise at settlement]
    J --> L[/Display rate and ten-day total/]
    X --> K([END])
    Y --> K
    Z --> K
    W --> K
    L --> K
